  storyText: "A Whisper\n\nA young Arasaka netrunner, Aiko, leans close while Ishida takes a call. \"I don't like what they do with things like her. I know a way out. Trust me?\"\n\n1. Trust Aiko.\n2. Report Aiko to Ishida."
